  "count": 2,
  "rationale": "Block kerberoast:credentialAccess and backupHost:lateralMovement. kerberoast is the only route to ssoLogin (an AND step), so blocking it kills ssoLogin. That in turn kills fileServer, then secretsManager and vaultRead, and also serviceAccount, which removes both dbReplica and codeRepo. backupHost is the sole parent of shareMount, so blocking it removes the last route to the target. No single block suffices: the shareMount route (iotDevice -> browserStore -> backupHost) shares no node with the ssoLogin/serviceAccount routes, and blocking dmzWeb still leaves browserStore reachable via iotDevice."
 },
